226
00:07:34.704 --> 00:07:36.737
Picture a made-up slot where the real

227
00:07:36.737 --> 00:07:38.289
drummer played a snare alone.

228
00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:40.644
With the noise it might arrive with a

229
00:07:40.644 --> 00:07:41.393
