243
00:08:08.901 --> 00:08:10.983
It was handed the real previous slot.

244
00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:14.702
When it is scored, and live once it is

245
00:08:14.702 --> 00:08:16.869
wired in, there is no real drummer to

246
00:08:16.869 --> 00:08:17.140
