252
00:08:27.593 --> 00:08:27.832
bias.

253
00:08:28.118 --> 00:08:29.885
For our feedback drummer it bit hard.

254
00:08:30.172 --> 00:08:32.130
Closed loop from silence, on the three

255
00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:34.231
