259
00:08:40.058 --> 00:08:41.682
Lesson four point eight goes deep.

260
00:08:43.079 --> 00:08:45.815
Only that one drummer, Rock C, is option

261
00:08:45.815 --> 00:08:45.936
C.

262
00:08:46.301 --> 00:08:48.855
Every other drummer we've reported, the

263
00:08:48.855 --> 00:08:51.530
LSTMs, the S4Ds, T one twenty-eight and

264
00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:54.206
the three genre drummers, never reads its

265
00:08:54.206 --> 00:08:54.814
own drums.

266
00:08:56.391 --> 00:08:58.474
So: memory crosses the chunk edge,

267
00:08:58.474 --> 00:09:00.507
gradients stop at it, five hundred and

268
00:09:00.507 --> 00:09:02.392
twelve slots in chunk mode, and the

269
00:09:02.392 --> 00:09:04.276
